LocFriendlyName="Disarming Shot (Pistol)"
LocFlyOverText="Disarming Shot (Pistol)"
LocLongDescription="Take a special <Ability:M31_BoundWeaponName> shot that disables the target's weapon, forcing them to reload before firing. Reduces the target's aim by <Ability:M31_DisarmingShot_AimPenalty> and critical chance by <Ability:M31_DisarmingShot_CritPenalty> for <Ability:M31_DisarmingShot_Duration> turn(s). Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown>-turn cooldown."
LocHelpText="Special <Ability:M31_BoundWeaponName> shot that disables the target's weapon, forcing them to reload before firing."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Affected by <font color='#0bff9b'>Quickdraw</font> and <font color='#0bff9b'>Bullet Time</font>.<br><Bullet> Requires <Ability:M31_PistolDisarmingShot_AmmoCost> ammo.<br><Bullet> Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown>-turn cooldown.<br><Bullet> Certain weapons, like Purifier Flamethrowers, cannot be disabled."

